<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech FinMin says govt committed to market cleanup.</title>
<headline>Czech FinMin says govt committed to market cleanup.</headline>
<dateline>BRNO, Czech Republic 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech Finance Minister Ivan Kocarnik said on Tuesday that the government was committed to strengthening the economy, especially tightening capital markets regulation and supervision.</p>
<p>&quot;The government must pay more attention than ever to legislation to guard our markets and their participants,&quot; Kocanrik said in his opening address at the FIBEX finance exhibition in the Czech second city of Brno.</p>
</text>
